Article 16
Implementation of protection for women is provided to: a. female workers/laborers;
b. elderly women;
c. women with disabilities;
d. homeless women;
e. domestic women workers;
f. women as family economic supporters;
g. women former inmates of correctional institutions; h. women victims of disaster;
